test "python authz: nested unreachable commit does not hide reachable branch commit"
  lang python
  expect VYQL-AUTH-095
  code
  ```
  @app.post("/records/<int:record_id>/archive")
  def archive_record(record_id, user_id, enabled):
      record = Record.query.filter(Record.id == record_id).first_or_404()
      if enabled:
          db.commit()
      if len(user_id) >= 0:
          return ""
          database.session.commit()
  ```
